-02T16:44:16Z","created_at_i":1785689056,"num_comments":23,"objectID":"49146065","points":28,"story_id":49146065,"title":"The Rise of Million-Dollar Companies with Just One Employee","updated_at":"2026-08-02T22:06:11Z","url":"https://www.wsj.com/tech/ai/the-rise-of-million-dollar-companies-with-just-one-employee-f36a77c1"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"vlad_kalinkin"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Show HN: Kakehashi \u2013 Experimental userspace to run macOS binaries on Linux ARM"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://github.com/wie-project/kakehashi"}},"_tags":["story","author_vlad_kalinkin","story_49145937","show_hn","front_page"],"author":"vlad_kalinkin","children":[49146269,49145939,49146486,49147354,49146285,49148770,49147427,49148054,49146813,49146309,49146229,49147238,49146721,49146413,49146292,49146531],"created_at":"2026-08-02T16:26:40Z","created_at_i":1785688000,"num_comments":33,"objectID":"49145937","points":132,"story_id":49145937,"title":"Show HN: Kakehashi \u2013 Experimental userspace to run macOS binaries on Linux ARM","updated_at":"2026-08-02T22:03:55Z","url":"https://github.com/wie-project/kakehashi"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"amronos"},"story_text":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Hey HN,\nI am 16y/o and have been working on Sprocket for a while. It's an open-source AI agent that beats every other agent out there at both hardware and software.<p>And here's the best part: Sprocket can (on its own) buy anything from any website when you tell it to do so. From hardware parts to SaaS subscriptions.<p>Sprocket retrieves best-in-class context from the web for everything it does. It is therefore incredibly reliable.\nThe agent harness's quality, performance, and UI rival that of Codex/Cursor/T3Code, and we are rapidly improving.\nWe will be releasing benchmarks on how Sprocket beats every other agent at both software and hardware soon.<p>In terms of hardware design, Sprocket can make beautiful schematics in react, create your BOM, and create detailed assembly instructions.<p>Hope you try it out!<p>Thanks,\nAarav<p>P.S. if the demo video doesn't load for you, come back after ~1.5hr and it should be there, I kinda had to submit this early. Sorry!"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Show HN: Sprocket \u2013 The Best AI Agent for Hardware and Software Development"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://sprocket-demo.spikonado.com"}},"_tags":["story","author_amronos","story_49145934","show_hn"],"author":"amronos","children":[49147234,49146899,49147337,49146779,49146994,49146119,49148480,49147745,49147030,49147050,49147004,49147034,49147031,49147064,49147011,49147056],"created_at":"2026-08-02T16:26:19Z","created_at_i":1785687979,"num_comments":11,"objectID":"49145934","points":117,"story_id":49145934,"story_text":"Hey HN,\nI am 16y&#x2F;o and have been working on Sprocket for a while. It&#x27;s an open-source AI agent that beats every other agent out there at both hardware and software.<p>And here&#x27;s the best part: Sprocket can (on its own) buy anything from any website when you tell it to do so. From hardware parts to SaaS subscriptions.<p>Sprocket retrieves best-in-class context from the web for everything it does. It is therefore incredibly reliable.\nThe agent harness&#x27;s quality, performance, and UI rival that of Codex&#x2F;Cursor&#x2F;T3Code, and we are rapidly improving.\nWe will be releasing benchmarks on how Sprocket beats every other agent at both software and hardware soon.<p>In terms of hardware design, Sprocket can make beautiful schematics in react, create your BOM, and create detailed assembly instructions.<p>Hope you try it out!<p>Thanks,\nAarav<p>P.S. if the demo video doesn&#x27;t load for you, come back after ~1.5hr and it should be there, I kinda had to submit this early. Sorry!","titl